1980
01:04:56,520 --> 01:04:58,080
So I end up dealing

1981
01:04:58,080 --> 01:04:59,280
with the emotions on my own.

1982
01:04:59,280 --> 01:05:00,760
I process all my emotions,

1983
01:05:00,760 --> 01:05:02,640
but no one ever
takes my words seriously.

1984
01:05:02,920 --> 01:05:03,960
Because I stay calm,

1985
01:05:03,960 --> 01:05:05,600
they don't see the issue.

1986
01:05:05,960 --> 01:05:07,880
You can't bottle it up.

1987
01:05:07,880 --> 01:05:08,960
You need to let yourself get mad.

1988
01:05:08,960 --> 01:05:10,040
Show them you're mad.

1989
01:05:10,120 --> 01:05:11,320
With some conviction, huh?

1990
01:05:11,320 --> 01:05:12,420
I think being emotionally stable

1991
01:05:12,420 --> 01:05:13,920
(Emotional stability isn't lack of emotion)
doesn't mean having no emotions.

1992
01:05:13,920 --> 01:05:15,040
Yeah.

1993
01:05:15,040 --> 01:05:16,080
It means

1994
01:05:16,080 --> 01:05:17,000
your emotions

1995
01:05:17,000 --> 01:05:18,240
rise and fall naturally,

1996
01:05:18,240 --> 01:05:19,040
but you know

1997
01:05:19,040 --> 01:05:20,600
how to deal with them.

1998
01:05:20,600 --> 01:05:21,160
Yes.

1999
01:05:21,160 --> 01:05:22,400
So if you're really hurt

2000
01:05:22,400 --> 01:05:23,680
in a relationship

2001
01:05:23,680 --> 01:05:24,920
and feel very sad,

2002
01:05:24,920 --> 01:05:25,960
you must express it clearly.

2003
01:05:25,960 --> 01:05:28,000
You need to be direct,

2004
01:05:28,000 --> 01:05:29,000
so the other person understands

2005
01:05:29,440 --> 01:05:30,000
that you're really upset

2006
01:05:30,000 --> 01:05:31,080
because of their actions.

2007
01:05:31,080 --> 01:05:32,300
(Accept your emotions)

2008
01:05:32,300 --> 01:05:33,460
(Express them honestly)

2009
01:05:33,480 --> 01:05:35,360
They want emotional stability

2010
01:05:35,360 --> 01:05:36,800
and don't want the silent treatment.

2011
01:05:36,800 --> 01:05:37,960
But I think sometimes

2012
01:05:37,960 --> 01:05:39,240
there will be some weaknesses.

2013
01:05:39,240 --> 01:05:40,000
I think

2014
01:05:40,000 --> 01:05:42,440
every strength comes with a weakness.

2015
01:05:42,440 --> 01:05:44,640
How do you decide on the trade off?

2016
01:05:44,840 --> 01:05:46,120
They share the same root.

2017
01:05:46,560 --> 01:05:48,040
So you have

2018
01:05:48,040 --> 01:05:49,960
to decide if you can accept

2019
01:05:49,960 --> 01:05:51,760
something like that in your partner.

2020
01:05:51,760 --> 01:05:52,680
Or what you can't accept.

2021
01:05:52,680 --> 01:05:54,320
You'll have to experience it to know.

2022
01:05:54,680 --> 01:05:55,360
I think what Yang Chaoyue

2023
01:05:55,360 --> 01:05:55,880
said

2024
01:05:55,880 --> 01:05:57,600
is called giving it some time.

2025
01:05:57,600 --> 01:05:58,880
I think it is different

2026
01:05:58,880 --> 01:06:00,560
compared to the silent treatment.

2027
01:06:00,560 --> 01:06:01,420
(Silent treatment ≠ Taking time)

2028
01:06:01,620 --> 01:06:03,160
Taking some time

2029
01:06:03,160 --> 01:06:04,840
means you're not doing it

2030
01:06:04,840 --> 01:06:06,520
to hurt

2031
01:06:06,520 --> 01:06:07,600
the other person.

2032
01:06:07,600 --> 01:06:09,000
But silent treatment,

2033
01:06:09,000 --> 01:06:10,040
whether intentional

2034
01:06:10,040 --> 01:06:10,440
or not,

2035
01:06:10,440 --> 01:06:11,200
is never okay,

2036
01:06:11,200 --> 01:06:12,200
because its purpose

2037
01:06:12,200 --> 01:06:13,520
is to punish the other person.

2038
01:06:13,520 --> 01:06:14,240
Yes.

2039
01:06:17,080 --> 01:06:18,320
I think

2040
01:06:18,320 --> 01:06:19,240
they all have

2041
01:06:19,240 --> 01:06:21,440
a strong sense of self.

2042
01:06:21,800 --> 01:06:23,560
When you're willing
to express your needs

2043
01:06:23,560 --> 01:06:24,760
so directly,

2044
01:06:25,240 --> 01:06:26,640
you're taking a risk

2045
01:06:26,640 --> 01:06:27,720
that people might reject you

2046
01:06:27,920 --> 01:06:29,560
or judge you for it.

2047
01:06:29,560 --> 01:06:30,640
So in a way,

2048
01:06:30,640 --> 01:06:32,360
it shows they're honest with themselves.

2049
01:06:32,360 --> 01:06:33,600
This honestly deserves

2050
01:06:33,600 --> 01:06:35,320
to be accepted and respected.

2051
01:06:39,380 --> 01:06:41,420
(Don't go anywhere. The next episode
is even more romantic.)
